However, I should still provide a design that is concrete and reproducible-on-paper. The three deliverables:

1) Input/repository inspection — inventory what exists in /workspace. Report: only task.json; no forward model code, no MD trajectories, no derived torsions/TICA. So all specifics are assumed. General expectations from the domain: forward simulation model = a generative sampler of peptide conformations (e.g., normalizing flow / diffusion / autoregressive over coordinates or internal coordinates) producing sampled trajectories; ground-truth MD = all-atom MD trajectories of tetrapeptides (likely with explicit solvent, force field like CHARMM36m/AMBER ff14SB, sampled via GROMACS/OpenMM). Backbone torsions φ/ψ per residue, sidechain χ1..χn, TICA computed on a torsion feature set via something like pyemma/MSMBuilder with periodic (von Mises/circular) handling. All of these are assumptions.

